      "outsideTopThreeSlots": 33,
      "priorToIssue32": { "absentSlots": 14, "outsideTopThreeSlots": 41 },
      "note": "Ceilings, not targets: a change may lower these, never raise them. Recorded after issue #32's catalog vocabulary edit, ASC reference binding, and the ranking/strict-match split. priorToIssue32 is what the same corpus measured before those landed, kept so the ratchet's direction stays legible. Raising a ceiling to make a change pass inverts this gate — lower the number or leave it alone."
